        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CL1532, Solid Brass Colonial Style Cabinet Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe colonial cabinet lock has two parts: the thumb turn lock mechanism and strike box. Turning the thumb turn knob, secures the lock. The classic colonial lock features solid brass construction which is resistant to corrosion. The Medium Size Colonial Cabinet Lock is surface mounted (screwed to the face of the door) with the included matching finish wood screws for easy installation. Locks like these are primarily used on cabinet doors, however they are also used on furniture doors, utility doors, pantry doors, any door, or windows. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-CL1532_size.gif?v=1704354720\" width=\"491\" height=\"188\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana CL1532 Solid Brass Colonial  Style Cabinet Lock Specification\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-large-size-colonial-cabinet-lock-deltana-cl1580\"><b>Large Colonial  Style Cabinet Lock</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana CL1532 Colonial Style Cabinet Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lock Body Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Body Height: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Body Projection: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Box Width: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Box Height: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CL1532.pdf?v=1691095315\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana  CL1532 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Medium Size Colonial Cabinet Lock | Deltana CL1532",
                "description": "Solid Brass Colonial Cabinet Lock Medium Deltana CL1532  - The colonial cabinet lock has two parts: the thumb turn lock mechanism and strike box. Turning the thumb turn knob, secures the lock. The classic colonial lock features solid brass construction which is resistant to corrosion. The Medium Size Colonial Cabinet Lock is surface mounted (screwed to the face of the door) with the included matching finish wood screws for easy installation. Locks like these are primarily used on cabinet doors, however they are also used on furniture doors, utility doors, pantry doors, any door, or windows. \r\n",
